.idea/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Claude Code local overrides (never committed) — EXCEPT the project
# instructions, which are versioned. They are the only record of several
# of this repo's conventions, because design logs are immutable snapshots
# and deviations from them are written down there instead; and
# packages/docs asserts against them. See issue #34.
#
# `.claude/*` rather than `.claude`: git does not descend into an ignored
# directory, so a negation inside one never matches. Same shape as the
# .vscode rule above, for the same reason.
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
.claude.local.md
